## 4. Product vision: one platform, multiple industry modules

Vyom consists of a shared platform and configurable domain modules. It
should not launch as a broad suite covering every industry at once.

### 4.1 Shared platform capabilities

**1. Universal ingestion** - Uploads, email intake, PDFs, scans,
spreadsheets and structured files - API and webhook ingestion -
Connectors to approved enterprise systems - File parsing, OCR where
needed, deduplication and source metadata

**2. AI understanding and extraction** - Classification and routing -
Entity and field extraction - Normalization into typed schemas -
Evidence spans linking extracted facts to source material - Confidence
and uncertainty indicators - Model selection by task, sensitivity,
latency and cost

**3. Decision and workflow engine** - Explicit workflow states and
transitions - Deterministic validation rules - Policy and criteria
evaluation - Missing-information detection and follow-up - Idempotent
actions, retries and exception queues - Human review and escalation -
Versioned workflow configurations

**4. Governance and trust layer** - Role-based access and tenant
isolation - Immutable or tamper-evident audit history - Model, prompt,
rule and workflow version tracking - Evaluation datasets and regression
tests - Approval policies and segregation of duties - Monitoring,
alerting and incident handling - Data retention and deletion controls

**5. Execution and output** - Reports and structured exports - API calls
and updates to approved systems - Notifications and task assignment -
Document generation from controlled templates - Review queues and
operational dashboards - Outcome measurement and feedback capture

**6. Platform administration** - Tenant and workspace management -
Configuration and template management - Usage and cost analytics -
Integration health - User, role and permission administration -
Operational service-level reporting

