## 11. Quality, security and governance

Governance is a platform capability, but specific regulatory obligations
differ by industry and geography. Vyom must not claim blanket compliance
simply because it has audit logs or human review.

### Baseline controls

-   Tenant isolation and least-privilege access
-   Encryption in transit and at rest
-   Secure secrets and key management
-   Documented retention, deletion and backup policies
-   Data processing agreements and subprocessor transparency
-   Access and action logs
-   Incident response and breach notification procedures
-   Model and workflow change control
-   Evaluation and release records
-   Human override, escalation and rollback paths
-   Customer-specific data boundaries; no cross-customer training
    without explicit authorization

### Domain-specific controls

Each module needs a separate regulatory and quality assessment
covering: - Applicable laws, standards and record-retention
obligations - Intended use and prohibited use - Validation requirements
and acceptance criteria - Required qualifications and accountable
approvers - Reporting formats and submission processes - Data residency
and cross-border transfer - Audit, inspection and vendor qualification
requirements

Certifications such as ISO 27001 or SOC 2 may become commercial
requirements, but timing should follow target-customer demands and
budget. They are goals, not current claims.

### Quality metrics

-   Extraction precision and recall by field
-   False-negative rate for high-impact items
-   Rule-validation pass rate
-   Human override and escalation rates
-   Duplicate and conflict detection quality
-   Workflow completion and exception rates
-   Turnaround time and rework
-   Cost per completed workflow
-   Traceability and audit completeness
-   Production incidents and customer-reported defects

Accuracy must be reported with dataset size, labels, evaluation method,
relevant error types and confidence intervals where appropriate. A
single aggregate accuracy score is not sufficient for high-impact
workflows.

